It got solved casually.  The real problem is that your hardware
reports bogus values.  As I mentioned, the warning there is no fatal
one.  The driver still continues to probe.  So, something else got
broken.

> Do you think there's a solution for me?
> Why don't work now?
> Do you need more logs of my system?

I'd reconsider to add some workaround if we can find any other report
with the very same hardware as yours...  Otherwise, I recommend you
repair, at least, update BIOS if possible.


